From 8b8b2dc2ebd3f9112c70e03afb8a9f5efb847223 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: halt95 <halt95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 00:01:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 31/58] ple_offload: carry the host-mapped pull transport onto
 v0.30.0

Restores the fork's PLE offload package (not upstream) and its pull
transport: the offload process holds no CUDA context; the captured op waits on
a device-mapped host flag and copies host->GPU on the model stream; publication
is fenced; releases are synchronous across dummy/capture work; failures close
the rank. Includes the test-only fault-injection cuts for the transport.
